{"5046190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KALA", "steam_appid": 5046190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KALA is a short, surreal, atmospheric, psychological horror experience.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After years of isolation, your life has become a ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, you wake up, take your rod, and head to the water. You gather bait, fish, and return to your cabin to eat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The routine is simple. You have performed it for so long that you no longer question it. But the ritual begins to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin adorning the altar with care, trying to capture her essence. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The sea begins returning things you never put into it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a remote island in first person</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fish, gather bait, and interact with your surroundings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consume raw fish</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow a simple daily routine that gradually begins to change</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover objects and events that reveal more about the protagonist's past</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a psychological horror story told through the environment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KALA is a short, surreal, atmospheric, psychological horror experience.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After years of isolation, your life has become a ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, you wake up, take your rod, and head to the water. You gather bait, fish, and return to your cabin to eat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The routine is simple. You have performed it for so long that you no longer question it. But the ritual begins to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin adorning the altar with care, trying to capture her essence. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The sea begins returning things you never put into it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a remote island in first person</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fish, gather bait, and interact with your surroundings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consume raw fish</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow a simple daily routine that gradually begins to change</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover objects and events that reveal more about the protagonist's past</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a psychological horror story told through the environment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Fish. Eat. Vomit. Adorn. Sleep. Repeat. KALA is a short, surreal horror game about a man who exiled himself to a remote island, haunted by the sins of his past.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5046190/87d6653c68731485f04957ea471d23a7f738dd90/header.jpg?t=1788179436", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5046190/faf793e9eca6b90a3d1952f11587e385bc19e159/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788179436", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5046190/faf793e9eca6b90a3d1952f11587e385bc19e159/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788179436", "w